prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Plaintiff most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Pass a preliminary decree declaring the share of the Plaintiff as {plaintiff_share_claimed} in the joint family / coparcenary properties described in the Schedule, and that of each defendant as enumerated;

b) Pass a final decree of partition by metes and bounds of the said properties through a Court Commissioner / Local Commission and allot separate possession of the Plaintiff's share;

c) Direct an accounting of the income, profits, and rents derived from the joint family properties by the defendants and pay over the Plaintiff's share thereof along with mesne profits;

d) Pass a permanent injunction restraining the Defendants from alienating, encumbering or otherwise dealing with the Plaintiff's share in the suit properties;

e) Declare that any alienations made by any defendant during the pendency of this suit are subject to the result of this suit u/s 52 TPA;

f) Award costs of the suit in favour of the Plaintiff;

g) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper.

And for this act of kindness, the Plaintiff shall ever pray.
